Data note: the curated CSV files in `data/` are derived from public NASA
Exoplanet Archive, Gaia DR3, and Kepler DR25 products and follow the access
conditions of those services. Third-party supplementary material from
Berger et al. (2020) referenced by the isochrone-crossmatch attempt
(`code/B1_get_berger_ages.py`, `code/B2_isochrone_gate.py`) is NOT
redistributed here; see `data/README.md` for its source and download route.